{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0125-valid-palindrome","title":"LeetCode 125 验证回文串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0125-valid-palindrome","wordCount":663,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-125-验证回文串\">LeetCode 125 验证回文串</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>如果在将所有大写字符转换为小写字符、并移除所有非字母数字字符之后，短语正着读和反着读都一样，则可以认为该短语是一个回文串。</p>\n<p>字母和数字都属于字母数字字符。</p>\n<p>给你一个字符串 <code>s</code>，如果它是回文串，返回 <code>true</code>；否则，返回 <code>false</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 2 × 10⁵</code></li>\n<li><code>s</code> 仅由可打印的 ASCII 字符组成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;A man, a plan, a canal: Panama&quot;&#10;输出：true&#10;解释：&quot;amanaplanacanalpanama&quot; 是回文串\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"A man, a plan, a canal: Panama\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：\"amanaplanacanalpanama\" 是回文串</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;race a car&quot;&#10;输出：false&#10;解释：&quot;raceacar&quot; 不是回文串\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"race a car\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：\"raceacar\" 不是回文串</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot; &quot;&#10;输出：true&#10;解释：在移除非字母数字字符之后，s 是一个空字符串 &quot;&quot;。空字符串正着反着读都一样，所以是回文串\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \" \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：在移除非字母数字字符之后，s 是一个空字符串 \"\"。空字符串正着反着读都一样，所以是回文串</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的核心是<strong>忽略非字母数字字符后判断回文</strong>。有两种主流思路：</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：预处理 + 反转比较</strong></p>\n<p>先将字符串清洗（转小写、去除非字母数字字符），得到一个纯净字符串，然后判断它是否等于其反转。这种方法直观但需要额外空间。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：首尾双指针（推荐）</strong></p>\n<p>使用左右两个指针从字符串两端向中间靠拢，跳过非字母数字字符，逐一比较对应字符。这种方法不需要创建新字符串，空间更优。</p>\n<p>双指针法的具体步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始化 <code>left = 0</code>，<code>right = s.length - 1</code></li>\n<li>当 <code>left &lt; right</code> 时循环：<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>s[left]</code> 不是字母数字字符，<code>left++</code> 跳过</li>\n<li>如果 <code>s[right]</code> 不是字母数字字符，<code>right--</code> 跳过</li>\n<li>比较两个字符的小写形式，不相等则返回 <code>false</code></li>\n<li>两指针向中间移动</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>遍历完成未发现不匹配，返回 <code>true</code></li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预处理 + 反转</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>代码简洁</td>\n<td>需要额外字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首尾双指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>原地操作</td>\n<td>需要处理跳过逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：首尾双指针（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isPalindrome(s: string): boolean {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = s.length - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt; right) {&#10;    while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; !isAlphaNumeric(s[left])) {&#10;      left++;&#10;    }&#10;    while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; !isAlphaNumeric(s[right])) {&#10;      right--;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (s[left].toLowerCase() !== s[right].toLowerCase()) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    left++;&#10;    right--;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return true;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function isAlphaNumeric(c: string): boolean {&#10;  return /[a-zA-Z0-9]/.test(c);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isPalindrome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAlphaNumeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s[left])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAlphaNumeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s[right])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s[left].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s[right].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isAlphaNumeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-zA-Z0-9]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：预处理 + 反转</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isPalindromeClean(s: string): boolean {&#10;  const cleaned = s.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, &#39;&#39;);&#10;  const reversed = cleaned.split(&#39;&#39;).reverse().join(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  return cleaned === reversed;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isPalindromeClean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cleaned</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a-z0-9]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reversed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleaned.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleaned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reversed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>方法二的代码更短，但创建了多个临时字符串。在面试中，面试官通常更期望看到双指针解法，因为它体现了对空间优化的意识。</p>\n<p>更高效的字符判断可以避免使用正则表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isAlphaNumericFast(c: string): boolean {&#10;  const code = c.charCodeAt(0);&#10;  return (code &gt;= 48 &amp;&amp; code &lt;= 57) || (code &gt;= 65 &amp;&amp; code &lt;= 90) || (code &gt;= 97 &amp;&amp; code &lt;= 122);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isAlphaNumericFast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">charCodeAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 48</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 57</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 65</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 97</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 122</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个字符最多被访问一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)（双指针）</td>\n<td>仅使用两个指针变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)（预处理）</td>\n<td>创建清洗后的字符串</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双指针回文判断是字符串类题目的基础模式。需要注意的细节包括：字符大小写转换、非字母数字字符的跳过、空字符串和纯特殊字符的边界情况。本题是 LC #680（验证回文串 II，允许删除一个字符）的前置基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 125 验证回文串","id":"leetcode-125-验证回文串"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 88 合并两个有序数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0088-merge-sorted-array"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 14 最长公共前缀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0014-longest-common-prefix"}}